	Section:
		Text: Stack
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Wrap items
		Paragraph: Without `Wrap items` all the items share one line, where they shrink down to their longest word. With `Wrap items: true`, an item that does not fit starts a new line, and each line is distributed on its own.
